WEBVTT

00:17.680 --> 00:21.900
[Underground of Soul-Cleansing Temple]

01:26.039 --> 01:27.039
Why did you call me back?

01:27.039 --> 01:28.840
Do you know what I was just doing?

01:29.140 --> 01:30.430
Who cares?

01:35.020 --> 01:36.620
Shrimpie appeared just now.

01:37.259 --> 01:38.160
I was waiting for him there.

01:38.160 --> 01:39.690
Do you know what he did?

01:40.150 --> 01:41.090
How would I know?

01:41.090 --> 01:43.289
Stop pretending. You know everything.

01:43.590 --> 01:44.920
You've known all along.

01:45.509 --> 01:46.979
How long are you going to lie to me?

01:46.979 --> 01:47.770
It's been 10 years!

01:47.770 --> 01:48.979
Do you still think
I'm the same as 10 years ago,

01:48.979 --> 01:50.150
doing whatever you tell me to do?

01:50.150 --> 01:50.870
Sit down!

01:54.250 --> 01:56.650
But I won't listen to
another word from you.

01:59.620 --> 02:00.510
Zhang Haixia.

02:02.010 --> 02:04.700
killed everyone in the priest's mansion.

02:05.200 --> 02:06.930
He even hung Priest Su Ya's body

02:06.930 --> 02:08.240
on the water cart

02:08.240 --> 02:09.979
just to avenge us.

02:11.340 --> 02:13.670
Do you know he's completely lost his mind?

02:14.520 --> 02:16.540
Didn't you see him
kill Great Golden Blade?

02:16.540 --> 02:18.010
Didn't you say that no matter what he did,

02:18.010 --> 02:18.740
you'd forgive him,

02:18.740 --> 02:20.800
clean up his mess, and bring him home?

02:24.150 --> 02:24.810
Where is he?

02:27.740 --> 02:29.340
Don't play this game with me.

02:29.560 --> 02:30.620
What does this have to do with

02:30.620 --> 02:32.220
you not telling me the truth?

02:41.630 --> 02:44.290
The antidote Zhang Haixia used
is also a poison.

02:44.460 --> 02:47.060
It will cause irreversible damage
to his mind.

02:47.460 --> 02:49.490
The agents who used this antidote before

02:49.490 --> 02:51.290
all went mad without exception.

02:51.460 --> 02:53.460
They went around attacking people/

02:53.930 --> 02:56.260
They couldn't control themselves at all.

03:00.810 --> 03:02.150
So I killed them all.

03:12.810 --> 03:14.070
He's already saved...

03:16.250 --> 03:18.250
and you're only telling me this now?

03:18.560 --> 03:21.290
Would it have changed anything
if I told you then?

03:22.120 --> 03:24.380
If you knew, would you not have saved him?

03:31.410 --> 03:32.800
Besides, Zhang Haixia

03:32.800 --> 03:34.530
carries clues about Mo Yungao.

03:35.960 --> 03:38.420
It concerns
the safety of countless people.

03:39.530 --> 03:41.390
Even if you didn't choose to do so,

03:42.500 --> 03:43.810
he had to live.

04:08.840 --> 04:10.570
You could have told me earlier.

04:13.900 --> 04:15.500
You and he both hid it from me.

04:16.310 --> 04:17.510
Was it for my own good?

04:19.360 --> 04:21.490
Have you ever considered my feelings?

04:25.250 --> 04:26.660
Well, now you know.

04:28.660 --> 04:30.060
If I asked you to kill him,

04:30.930 --> 04:32.150
could you do it?

04:48.330 --> 04:50.460
Then I have to at least talk to him once.

04:52.130 --> 04:53.500
He might have even shown up just now.

04:53.500 --> 04:55.300
Why on earth did you call me back?

05:02.430 --> 05:03.060
Got me to come back

05:03.060 --> 05:04.920
just to make me clean a darn pond.

05:05.600 --> 05:07.070
Keeping everything from me,

05:07.070 --> 05:08.470
not telling me anything.

05:08.930 --> 05:10.530
Am I not part of the Archives?

05:11.270 --> 05:13.400
Now making me some bullshit Director.

05:13.800 --> 05:15.460
Be it yourself in your coffin.

05:16.330 --> 05:17.750
Priest Su Ya of Bailejing

05:17.750 --> 05:19.350
died of illness previously.

05:20.160 --> 05:22.020
Someone brought him back to life.

05:22.360 --> 05:23.920
But after a few years,

05:23.920 --> 05:25.680
his temperament
suddenly changed drastically.

05:25.680 --> 05:27.740
Originally an honest and gentle man,

05:27.890 --> 05:29.380
he became bloodthirsty.

05:29.980 --> 05:30.920
If the Priest Su Ya's condition

05:30.920 --> 05:32.710
is the same as Zhang Haixia's,

05:33.310 --> 05:35.830
yet he could maintain
his original state for years,

05:35.830 --> 05:38.090
it means he has a way to restrain himself.

05:38.600 --> 05:40.360
Perhaps deep in Bailejing,

05:40.950 --> 05:42.880
there is a way to save Zhang Haixia.

05:50.330 --> 05:51.130
Mentor.

05:52.040 --> 05:54.840
Is it possible that
Priest Su Ya was saved by chief?

05:55.250 --> 05:57.270
Also, if he can cure your illness,

05:57.270 --> 05:58.740
can he also cure Shrimpie?

06:00.420 --> 06:01.310
Maybe.

06:05.370 --> 06:07.220
Don't think about
looking for Zhang Haixia.

06:07.220 --> 06:08.950
He is no longer who he used to be.

06:08.950 --> 06:10.980
If you can't realize this,

06:10.980 --> 06:12.740
then it's best you two don't meet.

06:12.740 --> 06:14.160
He is crazy, not stupid.

06:14.160 --> 06:15.160
He hasn't forgotten us.

06:15.160 --> 06:16.960
Zhang Hailou, think carefully.

06:17.370 --> 06:19.420
Zhang Haixia killed Priest Su Ya

06:19.420 --> 06:20.980
and let you see it,
but didn't come to see you—

06:20.980 --> 06:21.600
why?

06:27.330 --> 06:28.860
He's checking my reaction.

06:35.810 --> 06:37.580
Why did he kill so many people?

06:38.720 --> 06:40.930
Zhang Haixia
is an incredibly smart person.

06:40.930 --> 06:42.170
If he wants to do evil,

06:42.300 --> 06:44.600
even I don't have the confidence
to stop him.

06:44.600 --> 06:45.250
Do you know

06:45.250 --> 06:46.310
how terrifying the person

06:46.310 --> 06:47.840
you have to deal with now is?

06:49.130 --> 06:50.750
You'd better calm down.

06:51.360 --> 06:53.020
Otherwise, just like before,

06:53.270 --> 06:55.070
you'll do something you regret.

08:31.120 --> 08:37.510
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

08:37.760 --> 08:40.419
[Episode 27]

08:56.310 --> 08:58.150
[Soul-Cleansing Temple]

09:09.940 --> 09:10.770
You're back.

09:12.120 --> 09:13.310
I told my sister.

09:13.500 --> 09:14.960
I'm going to kill Mo Yungao

09:14.960 --> 09:16.820
to avenge my family and brothers.

09:17.290 --> 09:18.220
That's up to you.

09:21.400 --> 09:23.090
I will also kill Zhang Haixia.

09:23.910 --> 09:24.970
Is that up to me too?

09:29.030 --> 09:30.230
With the way he is now,

09:30.530 --> 09:32.010
it's hard for anyone to kill him.

09:32.010 --> 09:33.050
If you want to get yourself killed,

09:33.050 --> 09:34.250
I don't mind one more.

09:54.000 --> 09:54.670
Shrimpie.

09:56.530 --> 09:57.590
If you want to play,

09:59.370 --> 10:00.430
I'll play with you.

10:54.450 --> 10:56.550
Little Taoist, you're quite good at this.

10:56.550 --> 10:58.550
Is this how you used to pursue girls?

11:06.120 --> 11:07.580
Why are your ears red?

11:09.150 --> 11:10.630
Don't tell me...

11:12.270 --> 11:15.010
you're still a virgin?

11:22.630 --> 11:24.230
I know you're feeling awful.

11:24.790 --> 11:25.860
I also know

11:26.200 --> 11:28.030
you're like this because you lost

11:28.030 --> 11:29.430
your family and friends.

11:30.200 --> 11:32.330
But you still need to cherish your life

11:33.220 --> 11:34.530
and not hurt yourself.

11:36.030 --> 11:36.770
Or...

11:38.740 --> 11:40.400
their deaths would be in vain.

11:43.990 --> 11:44.790
Darn Taoist,

11:44.810 --> 11:45.980
you're still wet behind the ears!

11:45.980 --> 11:48.040
Stop acting all highly in front of me!

11:48.630 --> 11:50.580
That darn Taoist.

11:50.980 --> 11:53.040
He's obviously experienced nothing

11:53.870 --> 11:55.670
yet preach such big principles.

12:05.950 --> 12:07.480
I need to teach you a lesson.

12:17.420 --> 12:18.680
You're right.

12:19.480 --> 12:20.880
My friends are dead,

12:20.940 --> 12:22.000
and my family is dead too.

12:22.000 --> 12:22.820
Now,

12:23.320 --> 12:25.250
I'm the only one left in this world.

12:26.250 --> 12:27.530
Come and sit down.

12:28.220 --> 12:30.280
My life's so tough I might as well die.

12:36.340 --> 12:37.220
How am I

12:38.010 --> 12:39.440
supposed to live?

12:43.250 --> 12:44.050
Actually,

12:45.500 --> 12:46.820
it's normal to feel pain.

12:46.820 --> 12:48.960
But I'm in too much pain.

12:49.100 --> 12:50.010
I understand.

12:50.100 --> 12:51.450
Drink a little with me.

12:51.550 --> 12:52.080
I...

13:02.080 --> 13:04.240
I know why you want revenge.

13:05.960 --> 13:07.650
It's not for justice,

13:07.790 --> 13:10.290
it's to ease the pain in your heart.

13:11.630 --> 13:13.580
But let me tell you about revenge,

13:13.600 --> 13:14.860
-it isn't...
-Shut up!

13:29.390 --> 13:29.910
What...

13:30.500 --> 13:31.560
What are you doing?

13:32.270 --> 13:34.490
I've taken a fancy to you today.

13:44.770 --> 13:46.020
[Soul-Cleansing Temple]

13:50.580 --> 13:54.490
[Soul-Cleansing Temple]

14:38.150 --> 14:38.890
Robbery.

14:39.000 --> 14:39.760
Robbery?

14:40.080 --> 14:41.600
-I have no money.
-I don’t want your money.

14:41.600 --> 14:42.580
I want this.

14:43.630 --> 14:45.300
You want... manure?

14:45.740 --> 14:46.290
Go.

15:03.030 --> 15:03.980
The dung cart!

15:04.220 --> 15:05.240
My dung cart!

15:41.600 --> 15:43.370
Zhang Hailou, Zhang Hailou.

15:49.240 --> 15:50.460
Wh-Why...

15:50.460 --> 15:51.390
Why are you here?

15:54.200 --> 15:55.240
That's not how

15:55.240 --> 15:56.910
you sounded like last night.

15:57.340 --> 15:58.550
Last night...

16:00.510 --> 16:02.340
What did you give me to drink last night?

16:02.340 --> 16:03.050
Liquor.

16:04.360 --> 16:05.390
Get ready to go.

16:10.600 --> 16:12.260
The women of Phoenix Fortress

16:12.370 --> 16:13.370
are all mantises.

16:13.470 --> 16:15.730
They'll eat you after sleeping with you.

16:16.340 --> 16:17.340
Close your mouth.

16:17.340 --> 16:18.340
Hurry up and pack.

16:18.510 --> 16:19.940
We're leaving for Bone-Washing Cave.

16:19.940 --> 16:22.000
Your mentor and my mentor can't wait.

16:27.980 --> 16:30.110
We are top-tier wanted criminals now.

16:30.650 --> 16:32.250
We need to keep a low profile.

17:05.680 --> 17:11.410
[Soul-Cleansing Temple]

17:38.160 --> 17:39.490
You prepared the crate?

17:40.460 --> 17:42.110
How could you have
predicted everything so precisely?

17:42.110 --> 17:43.700
If you ever get into trouble,

17:43.700 --> 17:44.760
take 3 steps back.

17:45.110 --> 17:48.370
I'll be right behind you
to ensure you have a fallback plan.

17:49.810 --> 17:51.180
No matter what happens,

17:51.290 --> 17:53.490
you'll leave a fallback plan
for me too,

17:56.660 --> 17:57.520
right, Hailou?

17:57.900 --> 18:00.360
[Soul-Cleansing Temple]

18:04.050 --> 18:04.680
Brother!

18:04.680 --> 18:06.000
Let's go look over there!

18:06.000 --> 18:07.200
All right. Don't run!

18:10.700 --> 18:12.220
Brother, this way.

18:12.370 --> 18:13.360
Slowly.

18:14.140 --> 18:16.270
You went crazy the moment you came out.

18:18.460 --> 18:20.190
Why are you still following us?

18:20.570 --> 18:22.330
Didn't I tell you I want revenge?

18:22.330 --> 18:24.100
Since you know Zhang Haixia,

18:22.610 --> 18:26.440
[General Store]

18:24.270 --> 18:25.330
by following you,

18:25.400 --> 18:26.850
I will definitely be able to find him.

18:26.850 --> 18:28.250
You are overthinking it.

18:28.480 --> 18:29.820
He won't follow us anymore.

18:29.720 --> 18:31.860
[Wanted]

18:33.740 --> 18:34.530
Also,

18:34.530 --> 18:36.030
don't expect us to help you

18:36.030 --> 18:37.280
deal with Mo Yungao.

18:37.750 --> 18:40.510
I am trying to save my mentor now
and have no time to deal with him.

18:40.510 --> 18:41.310
I'd like a piece.

18:41.310 --> 18:42.220
Okay, sir.

18:42.660 --> 18:43.770
Did I ask you?

18:44.100 --> 18:45.500
Don't flatter yourself.

18:50.160 --> 18:52.220
Why does Bailejing
have festivals every day?

18:52.220 --> 18:53.660
And different ones too?

18:54.880 --> 18:55.900
Besides, why does everyone

18:55.900 --> 18:57.720
seem to have no reaction
to the death of the priest?

18:57.720 --> 18:59.970
Didn't you hear about
the new priest?

19:00.250 --> 19:01.880
Priest Su Ji took office

19:01.940 --> 19:03.830
-and is now the High Priest of Bailejing.
-The mountain bride is getting married!

19:03.830 --> 19:05.220
-Priest Su Ji...
-The mountain bride is getting married!

19:05.220 --> 19:07.330
-Is the younger brother of Priest Su Ya.
-The mountain bride is getting married!

19:07.330 --> 19:09.530
The mountain bride is getting married!

19:12.980 --> 19:15.240
This must be the Bone-Washing Ceremony.

19:16.440 --> 19:18.810
These people are here to wash their bones?

19:21.440 --> 19:23.300
It's the Bone-Washing Ceremony,

19:23.310 --> 19:27.040
yet this kid is shouting about
the mountain bride getting married.

19:27.700 --> 19:28.300
Ma'am.

19:29.270 --> 19:31.110
Aren't people here to wash their bones?

19:31.110 --> 19:33.830
But I just heard someone shouting about
the mountain bride getting married.

19:33.830 --> 19:35.960
They're both happening today.

19:36.980 --> 19:38.980
The marriage and the bone-washing?

19:51.180 --> 19:51.610
Here.

19:56.330 --> 19:56.900
Ma'am.

19:58.640 --> 19:59.850
Why is it you again?

19:59.880 --> 20:01.140
First time strangers, second time friends.

20:01.140 --> 20:02.440
Ma'am, let me ask you,

20:02.900 --> 20:04.030
what are these people doing?

20:04.030 --> 20:05.640
Why are everyone leaving after placing

20:05.640 --> 20:06.830
their bone urns here?

20:06.830 --> 20:08.350
Aren't they supposed to go wash the bones?

20:08.350 --> 20:10.510
People here don't go to wash the bones.

20:10.510 --> 20:12.940
The bridal procession for
the mountain bride will go on our behalf.

20:12.940 --> 20:13.800
On your behalf?

20:13.920 --> 20:15.180
You don't go in person?

20:15.240 --> 20:16.000
In the past,

20:16.030 --> 20:17.750
we would go to wash the bones ourselves.

20:17.750 --> 20:19.270
But this year the priest said

20:19.270 --> 20:20.570
to let the mountain bride's procession

20:20.570 --> 20:21.470
go for us.

20:21.850 --> 20:23.290
The girl to be sent to the mountain

20:23.290 --> 20:25.030
is to be the wife
of our Bailejing's guardian deity,

20:25.030 --> 20:26.410
Feikun Balu.

20:26.920 --> 20:28.290
Letting her wash the bones on our behalf

20:28.290 --> 20:30.630
will allow our loved ones
to rest in peace.

20:31.530 --> 20:32.250
Thank you.

20:32.530 --> 20:34.000
Excuse me.

20:34.000 --> 20:35.420
Can I go in together with my mentor

20:35.420 --> 20:36.140
later?

20:36.140 --> 20:36.530
No.

20:36.530 --> 20:36.920
No.

20:37.680 --> 20:38.250
No.

20:38.500 --> 20:38.900
Huh?

20:40.380 --> 20:42.250
Didn't we agree to go to Bone-Washing Cave
to find the chief?

20:42.250 --> 20:44.450
Why can my mentor only go by himself now?

20:44.700 --> 20:45.830
What does this mean?

20:47.380 --> 20:48.590
They are collecting bones now.

20:48.590 --> 20:50.250
The ceremony is later, right?

20:51.610 --> 20:52.580
Scatter first.

20:52.740 --> 20:56.400
Then find a chance to sneak
into the mountain bride's procession.

21:00.740 --> 21:01.420
Thank you.

21:15.810 --> 21:16.770
I'll follow first.

21:16.770 --> 21:18.630
You guys find a chance to sneak in.

21:20.610 --> 21:21.790
I'll follow her first.

21:21.790 --> 21:23.650
You guys find a chance to sneak in.

21:33.440 --> 21:34.440
Fabrics for sale!

21:34.500 --> 21:35.640
Come and take a look.

21:36.090 --> 21:37.950
Many patterns and pretty styles.

21:38.160 --> 21:39.350
We have all kinds.

21:40.830 --> 21:42.200
This fabric is really good.

21:42.200 --> 21:43.440
Miss, come take a look.

21:43.440 --> 21:44.480
Our new fabrics

21:44.480 --> 21:45.880
will suit you perfectly.

21:46.330 --> 21:47.400
You have great taste, miss.

21:47.400 --> 21:48.980
This fabric suits you very well.

21:48.980 --> 21:51.240
You'll definitely look beautiful in it.

22:01.330 --> 22:01.740
I...

22:08.270 --> 22:09.480
Do you like me?

22:19.650 --> 22:20.280
I...

22:23.640 --> 22:26.100
If I asked you
to take responsibility for me,

22:29.180 --> 22:30.240
would you marry me?

22:42.440 --> 22:44.220
I knew it. You're a hypocrite.

22:45.530 --> 22:46.270
I will!

22:51.050 --> 22:51.830
What did you say?

22:51.830 --> 22:52.440
I said,

22:52.590 --> 22:53.770
I will marry you.

22:53.790 --> 22:54.900
I will take care of you.

22:54.900 --> 22:58.560
I am willing to take responsibility
for you for the rest of my life.

23:10.180 --> 23:16.060
♪ The past fades into traces on the page ♪

23:12.140 --> 23:13.340
The rest of your life?

23:14.510 --> 23:16.570
We've only known each other for a day.

23:17.270 --> 23:22.980
♪ A silent breeze
brushes past that lingering warmth ♪

23:17.750 --> 23:18.570
Besides,

23:19.110 --> 23:20.500
who would marry a

23:20.500 --> 23:22.700
poor Taoist who only lives on a mountain?

23:22.700 --> 23:23.760
I was tricking you.

23:24.370 --> 23:30.240
♪ In this fleeting world,
I long for a moment of vivid life ♪

23:31.390 --> 23:35.960
♪ I may have a chance to open a door ♪

23:33.640 --> 23:36.100
You didn't really think
I liked you, did you?

23:37.460 --> 23:43.930
♪ Where love and wish
meet in a fleeting moment ♪

23:44.730 --> 23:50.880
♪ There's no need to ask questions
in the maze ♪

23:47.960 --> 23:49.850
I'm leaving. Don't follow me.

23:51.630 --> 23:53.860
♪ The world's bustle ♪

23:54.440 --> 23:59.350
♪ Can briefly warm those
under a shared roof ♪

24:00.140 --> 24:01.070
Slowly.

24:00.430 --> 24:06.120
♪ And the story has come to an end ♪

24:01.070 --> 24:02.800
Watch out for the people ahead.

24:04.180 --> 24:05.980
This chief really knows how to enjoy life.

24:05.980 --> 24:07.770
This girl is quite pretty.

24:09.570 --> 24:10.880
What are you looking at?

24:10.880 --> 24:13.080
This is the central stall of the street.

24:13.200 --> 24:16.600
The mountain bride procession
will definitely pass by here.

24:23.980 --> 24:25.240
This one looks quite nice.

24:25.240 --> 24:25.640
It should—

24:25.640 --> 24:27.790
Do you really think
we're here for shopping?

24:27.790 --> 24:29.220
It should suit me.

24:29.850 --> 24:31.510
Why don't you help me put it on?

24:38.050 --> 24:39.850
I can't beat him up in the street.

24:43.330 --> 24:43.850
Done.

24:44.830 --> 24:45.440
All right.

24:45.440 --> 24:46.170
I'll take it.

24:47.700 --> 24:48.310
Thank you.

24:50.610 --> 24:51.740
Want some barbecue?

24:54.980 --> 24:56.110
That's my disciple.

24:56.220 --> 24:56.950
My disciple.

24:57.200 --> 24:58.400
I taught him well.

24:59.000 --> 24:59.570
I taught him well.

24:59.570 --> 25:00.170
All right.

25:00.640 --> 25:01.570
Have a taste.

25:04.000 --> 25:04.590
Have one?

25:24.010 --> 25:24.610
It's good.

25:56.700 --> 25:57.440
Why does this bride's wedding dress

25:57.440 --> 25:58.880
look so familiar?

25:59.370 --> 26:00.800
[Yue Shu, the bride]

26:03.510 --> 26:04.090
Wanduo?

26:06.050 --> 26:08.450
So Wanduo is going to be
the mountain bride.

26:08.660 --> 26:10.920
What's the deal with the mountain bride?

26:11.090 --> 26:13.290
Why turn them into something like this?

26:15.640 --> 26:16.190
Hey!

26:21.640 --> 26:23.370
Miss, this doesn't feel right.

26:25.440 --> 26:26.280
Save me!

26:26.600 --> 26:28.220
The bride is being snatched!

26:28.220 --> 26:29.200
Somebody come quick!

26:29.200 --> 26:29.850
The bride is being snatched!

26:29.850 --> 26:30.650
Hurry!

26:30.980 --> 26:33.490
The bride has been snatched away!

26:48.830 --> 26:49.700
What did you do?

26:49.700 --> 26:51.220
We haven't even been here
for even an hour.

26:51.220 --> 26:52.290
I didn't do anything.

26:52.290 --> 26:53.350
All I did was act a little vain

26:53.350 --> 26:55.010
and put on a silver accessory.

26:58.750 --> 26:59.160
Hurry!

26:59.770 --> 27:00.270
Quick!

27:00.610 --> 27:01.160
Hurry!

27:01.350 --> 27:01.900
Let's go!

27:07.240 --> 27:07.790
Sir,

27:08.830 --> 27:10.770
did you see two men
looking like they were running away?

27:10.770 --> 27:11.610
What?

27:12.290 --> 27:13.150
He's asking you

27:13.270 --> 27:14.700
if you have you seen two men—

27:14.700 --> 27:15.850
one looking like a Taoist priest

27:15.850 --> 27:16.880
and one pretty boy?

27:16.880 --> 27:18.140
Nope, didn't see them.

27:18.140 --> 27:18.800
I'm busy.

27:18.980 --> 27:20.310
Go away.

27:23.010 --> 27:24.610
Did they go to the other side?

27:26.010 --> 27:27.710
We can't cross with weapons.

27:30.250 --> 27:32.110
This side of the river
is called Balianjie.

27:32.110 --> 27:33.630
The authorities
on both sides don't get along.

27:33.630 --> 27:34.850
They are carrying swords,

27:34.850 --> 27:36.330
so they definitely wouldn't dare go there.

27:36.330 --> 27:37.190
Why don't we...

27:37.510 --> 27:39.000
go hide on the other side of the river?

27:39.000 --> 27:39.530
Let's go.

27:42.830 --> 27:43.350
If we

27:43.960 --> 27:44.900
stay here,

27:44.900 --> 27:46.700
can Feng Huang and Madam find us?

27:46.880 --> 27:48.480
My mentor gets away quickly.

27:48.740 --> 27:49.440
Anyway, we have to

27:49.440 --> 27:51.100
meet up at Bone-Washing Cave.

27:51.270 --> 27:52.870
We shouldn't worry too much.

27:55.880 --> 27:57.660
What's the deal with that bride?

27:57.660 --> 27:58.640
Do you know her?

27:59.680 --> 28:00.480
No.

28:01.200 --> 28:02.440
It was after seeing my tattoo

28:02.440 --> 28:04.370
that she stopped to ask me for help.

28:04.720 --> 28:05.700
What tattoo?

28:06.090 --> 28:08.550
My tattoo is quite special.
It's right here.

28:09.480 --> 28:10.740
The girl recognized it at a glance

28:10.740 --> 28:11.800
and asked for help.

28:12.070 --> 28:14.130
It means she is very familiar with us.

28:14.920 --> 28:15.940
You are also from the Zhang family.

28:15.940 --> 28:17.740
Do you know much about the chief?

28:18.090 --> 28:18.750
What about?

28:18.750 --> 28:19.350
The chief

28:20.310 --> 28:21.440
has a similar tattoo

28:21.460 --> 28:22.740
right here.

28:23.050 --> 28:24.420
We are newcomers here.

28:25.250 --> 28:27.050
If the people here know about this tattoo,

28:27.050 --> 28:28.710
the chief must have told them.

28:29.590 --> 28:30.960
But why would the chief tell someone

28:30.960 --> 28:32.760
about this tattoo for no reason?

28:32.940 --> 28:35.470
Their relationship must be
beyond ordinary.

28:35.810 --> 28:36.500
Or perhaps,

28:37.160 --> 28:39.020
she saw the tattoo, and he had to

28:39.220 --> 28:40.330
explain it to her.

28:42.960 --> 28:44.850
See, that relationship
is even more unusual.

28:44.850 --> 28:47.380
He must have said it
when they were going at it.

28:48.960 --> 28:50.440
Going at what?

28:51.250 --> 28:52.110
Consummation.

28:55.000 --> 28:56.070
What are you saying?

28:56.070 --> 28:58.400
How could the chief
be that kind of person?

28:59.160 --> 29:00.440
Do you know him well?

29:02.310 --> 29:03.180
This chief,

29:03.180 --> 29:05.310
I heard he is apathetic.

29:06.010 --> 29:07.140
Let alone romance,

29:07.140 --> 29:08.140
he barely even eats.

29:08.140 --> 29:09.610
He has an eccentric temperament—
who'd have thought?

29:09.610 --> 29:11.000
After moving to Nanqiang
to live in seclusion,

29:11.000 --> 29:12.200
he would actually...

29:12.810 --> 29:14.670
talk to someone about his tattoo?

29:14.900 --> 29:16.050
But this place is quite lively,

29:16.050 --> 29:17.900
and that girl is absolutely gorgeous.

29:17.900 --> 29:19.090
The chief sure has good taste.

29:19.090 --> 29:20.370
He acts like a wild man.

29:21.850 --> 29:22.980
The most outrageous thing

29:22.980 --> 29:25.220
she asked for my help
when she was

29:25.420 --> 29:26.850
on her way to getting married.

29:26.850 --> 29:27.980
What does this mean?

29:28.140 --> 29:31.010
It means it wasn't the chief
she was getting married to.

29:31.010 --> 29:32.740
It seems there's something up
with Feikun Balu.

29:32.740 --> 29:33.490
Whatever.

29:34.180 --> 29:35.590
Since she's the chief's woman,

29:35.590 --> 29:36.850
she must be protected.

29:37.090 --> 29:39.220
She should have clues
about the chief.

29:39.590 --> 29:41.090
We can also take the chance to figure out,

29:41.090 --> 29:43.220
what this mountain bride is all about.

29:43.740 --> 29:44.270
Let's go.

29:46.510 --> 29:48.170
I have no money to pay the bill.

29:48.980 --> 29:50.110
You're out of money?

29:58.630 --> 29:59.220
Let's go.

30:06.570 --> 30:07.140
Sir.

30:07.640 --> 30:08.840
Have you seen two men?

30:08.980 --> 30:11.220
One looks like a Taoist priest,
the other a pretty boy?

30:11.220 --> 30:12.250
No, no.

30:17.330 --> 30:18.460
Go ask someone else.

30:18.720 --> 30:19.250
Let's go.

30:25.400 --> 30:26.010
Sir.

30:26.900 --> 30:27.830
Have you seen

30:27.830 --> 30:29.240
an outsider with a beast tattoo?

30:29.240 --> 30:30.370
A tattoo right here.

30:39.000 --> 30:39.600
What about him?
